WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.860
=Episode 24=

01:36.050 --> 01:37.810
I heard Wutuo has attacked Huayuan.

01:38.009 --> 01:38.650
Really?

01:39.450 --> 01:40.850
Wutuo just got defeat in Jiyang.

01:41.050 --> 01:41.970
They attacked Huayuan?

01:42.289 --> 01:43.410
It's true.

01:43.970 --> 01:45.729
Someone just reported it to Mr. Shen,

01:45.890 --> 01:46.850
and I overheard it.

01:49.330 --> 01:50.650
(Wutuo attacked Huayuan?)

01:51.009 --> 01:52.890
(First Jiyang, now Huayuan.)

01:53.090 --> 01:53.970
(Wutuo)

01:54.370 --> 01:55.250
(seems to be probing)

01:55.250 --> 01:56.610
(our military capabilities.)

01:57.130 --> 01:58.450
(They might plan to start a war.)

01:59.330 --> 02:00.730
General Feihong's leading

02:01.010 --> 02:01.890
the troops to Huayuan.

02:02.530 --> 02:03.810
He'll surely crush

02:03.810 --> 02:04.930
those Wutuo soldiers!

02:05.730 --> 02:06.490
Definitely.

02:08.009 --> 02:09.530
(He Rufei is going to Huayuan?)

02:14.000 --> 02:16.829
(Yezhou Garrison)

02:18.970 --> 02:19.850
What a spectacle!

02:21.050 --> 02:22.290
Who are they receiving?

02:24.250 --> 02:24.800
Fine.

02:25.170 --> 02:26.290
You'll find out soon.

02:34.050 --> 02:35.130
Been in the army so long,

02:35.610 --> 02:37.090
surely you've heard of Yan He?

02:37.890 --> 02:39.250
A classmate of Huaijin and me.

02:40.090 --> 02:40.610
Look!

02:40.930 --> 02:42.170
Now he acts all dignified.

02:47.480 --> 02:52.490
(Exam Paper, C)

02:52.490 --> 02:54.210
Why am I second from last again?

02:54.329 --> 02:55.810
Why am I still last?

02:56.230 --> 02:59.170
(Exam Paper, D)

03:00.770 --> 03:01.570
Didn't we agree

03:01.570 --> 03:02.690
you'd let me win once?

03:03.170 --> 03:03.730
First,

03:03.930 --> 03:05.210
I never agreed.

03:05.450 --> 03:06.130
Second,

03:06.410 --> 03:06.970
am I

03:07.170 --> 03:08.450
much better than you?

03:09.170 --> 03:09.890
Well...

03:10.530 --> 03:11.730
- I...
- Look!

03:12.170 --> 03:12.770
This...

03:23.010 --> 03:23.730
Who are you?

03:24.010 --> 03:25.380
- The Second.
- The one you beat.

03:27.450 --> 03:28.530
I'm Yan He.

03:29.090 --> 03:29.850
In the next exam,

03:30.290 --> 03:31.410
I'll take first place!

03:33.170 --> 03:34.290
How dare he say so?

03:35.010 --> 03:35.650
Xiao Huaijin,

03:36.410 --> 03:37.050
mark my words!

03:38.650 --> 03:39.610
Let's wait and see.

03:43.490 --> 03:44.290
Oh my.

03:59.640 --> 04:00.970
(Yan He, Wei Dynasty General)

04:00.970 --> 04:01.530
Hello.

04:01.970 --> 04:02.690
Long time no see.

04:03.250 --> 04:04.050
General Fengyun.

04:07.410 --> 04:08.410
Long time no see.

04:13.690 --> 04:14.770
It's been many years,

04:15.250 --> 04:16.209
they are still at odds?

04:24.970 --> 04:25.770
Chu Zhao?

04:31.290 --> 04:32.930
Came to award someone?

04:33.570 --> 04:34.090
Right.

04:34.570 --> 04:35.130
You have

04:35.290 --> 04:36.090
defended Jiyang.

04:39.650 --> 04:40.650
He Yan, heed the decree!

04:51.130 --> 04:53.210
Yezhou Garrison He Yan,

04:53.530 --> 04:54.750
you have exceptional loyalty

04:54.850 --> 04:55.890
and combat prowess.

04:56.330 --> 04:58.370
Your repeated victories against Wutuo

04:58.730 --> 04:59.690
have pleased me.

04:59.970 --> 05:01.490
Hereby you are promoted

05:01.770 --> 05:02.810
to be General Wu'an.

05:05.170 --> 05:06.090
General Wu'an.

05:11.850 --> 05:12.730
I, He Yan,

05:13.010 --> 05:13.850
appreciate it.

05:24.690 --> 05:26.530
Xiao Jue, you've defended Jiyang,

05:27.090 --> 05:27.930
but disobeyed orders

05:28.210 --> 05:29.090
and got absent.

05:29.770 --> 05:30.970
By the imperial decree,

05:31.530 --> 05:32.570
you shall be caned

05:33.050 --> 05:33.970
by 20 strikes.

05:36.409 --> 05:37.610
(We share the same merits.)

05:37.730 --> 05:38.690
(I got the reward,)

05:39.130 --> 05:40.409
(yet Xiao Jue got punishment.)

05:40.930 --> 05:41.610
(This is to)

05:41.610 --> 05:42.770
(drive a wedge between us.)

05:43.450 --> 05:44.450
Commander won the battle!

05:44.690 --> 05:45.450
Why punish him?

05:45.570 --> 05:46.250
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

05:46.290 --> 05:46.850
This is

05:46.850 --> 05:47.770
unfair!

05:48.210 --> 05:49.050
Punish the general,

05:49.050 --> 05:49.570
what for?

05:49.730 --> 05:50.250
Exactly!

05:50.450 --> 05:50.970
He defended

05:51.010 --> 05:51.810
Jiyang too!

05:52.130 --> 05:52.930
- Exactly!
- Exactly!

05:54.770 --> 05:55.409
Silence!

05:59.210 --> 06:00.730
If order-breakers go unpunished,

06:00.970 --> 06:02.490
and others will follow suit,

06:02.930 --> 06:03.940
where's the discipline?

06:14.090 --> 06:14.650
I

06:15.810 --> 06:16.530
accept it.

06:19.290 --> 06:20.090
Good, Xiao Huaijin.

06:21.010 --> 06:22.290
You uphold your family's honor.

06:22.810 --> 06:24.450
Then I'll carry out the punishment.

06:25.010 --> 06:26.410
Chu Zhao from the Ministry of War

06:26.770 --> 06:27.570
will oversee it.

06:28.490 --> 06:29.450
Seriously?

06:29.850 --> 06:30.450
20 strikes

06:30.450 --> 06:31.290
could kill him!

06:31.570 --> 06:32.170
Back off.

06:39.730 --> 06:40.290
20 strikes!

06:40.530 --> 06:41.170
Exactly.

06:45.330 --> 06:45.930
Punishment...

06:46.250 --> 06:47.050
Why?

07:31.530 --> 07:32.570
Yan Nanguang

07:33.170 --> 07:34.330
shows no mercy at all.

07:35.370 --> 07:37.010
Might be doing it for a private grudge.

07:59.090 --> 07:59.650
Xiao Jue.

08:00.490 --> 08:01.570
Your merits offset faults.

08:01.970 --> 08:02.610
Remember,

08:02.890 --> 08:03.450
never again.

08:20.650 --> 08:21.330
I

08:23.010 --> 08:24.250
get it.

08:32.010 --> 08:32.510
Huaijin.

08:37.890 --> 08:38.730
Congratulations!

08:42.370 --> 08:43.770
You petitioned for my promotion?

08:45.770 --> 08:46.430
Right.

08:47.450 --> 08:48.370
You did very well.

08:48.690 --> 08:49.330
This reward

08:49.530 --> 08:50.530
is what you deserve.

08:51.970 --> 08:53.810
I left Yezhou Garrison
without permission too.

08:54.290 --> 08:55.570
Regarding the discipline,

08:56.010 --> 08:56.890
I am also guilty.

09:00.050 --> 09:00.930
It was the Chancellor

09:01.330 --> 09:02.650
who advised His Majesty

09:03.290 --> 09:04.930
to offer fair rewards and punishments.

09:06.130 --> 09:06.770
Commander Xiao

09:07.690 --> 09:08.930
is a regional commander,

09:09.650 --> 09:11.610
should lead by example

09:12.210 --> 09:13.530
and set the standard,

09:14.490 --> 09:16.210
so should take this minor punishment.

09:17.410 --> 09:18.290
(As expected,)

09:19.170 --> 09:20.650
(Xu Jingfu is behind all this.)

09:25.570 --> 09:26.850
In that case,

09:29.890 --> 09:31.410
convey my thanks to Chancellor Xu.

10:19.010 --> 10:19.580
Huaijin.

10:19.850 --> 10:21.090
Let me tell you,

10:21.250 --> 10:21.810
if I hurt you

10:22.210 --> 10:23.490
carelessly,

10:23.930 --> 10:24.530
forgive me.

11:04.210 --> 11:05.650
Why are you silent?

11:06.290 --> 11:07.650
Are you displeased with me?

11:08.970 --> 11:09.570
How about

11:10.010 --> 11:11.170
I find someone else

11:11.290 --> 11:12.010
to apply medicine?

11:13.210 --> 11:14.130
Like

11:14.650 --> 11:15.200
He Yan?

11:17.290 --> 11:18.210
Shut up!

11:20.850 --> 11:22.010
You ungrateful guy!

11:27.690 --> 11:28.330
Wait a moment.

11:28.810 --> 11:29.730
I'll go check

11:29.730 --> 11:30.290
the decoction.

11:40.660 --> 11:44.190
(Xiao)

12:23.930 --> 12:25.090
Being publicly caned

12:25.570 --> 12:27.130
must have humiliated you.

12:27.690 --> 12:28.850
Chancellor Xu

12:29.090 --> 12:29.890
deliberately used

12:30.010 --> 12:31.010
such a trick

12:31.050 --> 12:31.610
to annoy you.

12:31.850 --> 12:32.970
Don't blame it on

12:32.970 --> 12:33.930
Miss He.

12:34.570 --> 12:35.770
She disguising as a man

12:36.490 --> 12:37.770
remains a hidden danger.

12:38.730 --> 12:39.730
If it gets exposed,

12:40.090 --> 12:41.050
she would be punished.

12:42.130 --> 12:43.410
Now she gets promoted,

12:44.130 --> 12:45.650
I wonder if it's blessing.

12:53.050 --> 12:53.970
You, Yan Nanguang!

12:54.250 --> 12:55.050
Why come here?

12:55.290 --> 12:55.970
You hit him hard!

12:55.970 --> 12:57.130
With so many eyes watching,

12:57.290 --> 12:58.450
I can't show mercy publicly.

12:58.530 --> 12:59.300
You!

12:59.610 --> 13:00.210
Not my face!

13:09.650 --> 13:10.250
Cold Xiao.

13:10.690 --> 13:11.250
Sorry.

13:14.290 --> 13:14.930
No need.

13:15.890 --> 13:17.210
You were just doing your duty.

13:18.090 --> 13:18.810
Don't be sorry.

13:19.490 --> 13:20.060
Hey,

13:20.490 --> 13:21.850
you came empty-handed?

13:23.730 --> 13:24.810
I wanted to bring medicine,

13:25.130 --> 13:25.930
but then realized

13:26.610 --> 13:27.610
you are

13:27.610 --> 13:28.170
here.

13:28.650 --> 13:29.930
Why bother?

13:30.330 --> 13:31.050
You two,

13:31.250 --> 13:32.130
at Xianchang Academy,

13:32.210 --> 13:33.130
were really at odds,

13:33.490 --> 13:35.130
yet now seem quite close.

13:35.650 --> 13:36.370
That's all

13:36.650 --> 13:37.770
in the past.

13:38.290 --> 13:39.530
Now we're all comrades.

13:39.970 --> 13:40.510
Right?

13:41.050 --> 13:41.570
Moreover,

13:41.850 --> 13:43.170
I'm now a married man,

13:43.770 --> 13:44.850
should be magnanimous.

13:45.730 --> 13:46.290
Otherwise,

13:46.650 --> 13:47.810
Chengxiu will nag me again.

13:48.210 --> 13:49.730
We know your wife is expecting.

13:49.930 --> 13:50.970
No need to tell us again.

13:51.690 --> 13:53.130
I want the whole world to know

13:53.490 --> 13:54.210
Chengxiu and I are

13:54.410 --> 13:55.090
having a child!

13:55.370 --> 13:56.410
Then on the battlefields,

13:56.690 --> 13:57.890
stop acting recklessly.

13:58.210 --> 13:59.290
Think about your family.

13:59.730 --> 14:00.410
Of course.

14:01.090 --> 14:01.690
Anyway,

14:01.690 --> 14:02.810
His Majesty didn't pick me

14:03.050 --> 14:04.010
to Huayuan,

14:04.770 --> 14:05.970
but that He Rufei.

14:06.170 --> 14:06.730
What?

14:07.370 --> 14:08.810
Why He Rufei?

14:15.730 --> 14:16.490
I'm tired.

14:17.770 --> 14:18.570
You guys go out.

14:18.810 --> 14:19.850
Take your medicine.

14:21.770 --> 14:22.530
Let me tell you,

14:22.850 --> 14:24.090
you were too harsh.

14:24.370 --> 14:25.410
20 strikes!

14:26.090 --> 14:26.890
Just plead for him.

14:26.890 --> 14:28.010
Too many people there.

14:37.130 --> 14:37.970
Has Feinu's message

14:38.330 --> 14:38.940
arrived?

14:39.850 --> 14:40.490
Commander.

14:41.090 --> 14:42.210
After the Mingshui Battle,

14:42.210 --> 14:42.810
Chu Zhao once

14:43.010 --> 14:43.930
visited Que City.

14:44.490 --> 14:45.570
Our agents discovered

14:45.850 --> 14:47.490
he made contact with Chai Anxi.

14:48.370 --> 14:49.330
How about before that?

14:49.890 --> 14:50.610
Before that,

14:50.930 --> 14:51.570
we detected

14:51.690 --> 14:53.210
nothing on Chu Zhao.

14:53.650 --> 14:54.450
The Mingshui Battle

14:54.850 --> 14:56.090
might have nothing to him.

14:58.890 --> 14:59.610
And He Rufei?

15:00.290 --> 15:01.090
He Rufei

15:01.370 --> 15:02.010
and Xu Jingfu

15:02.170 --> 15:02.970
had no interactions

15:03.330 --> 15:04.290
before Mingshui Battle.

15:04.890 --> 15:06.450
But after the Mingshui Battle started,

15:06.810 --> 15:07.410
the two of them

15:07.610 --> 15:08.530
grew close.

15:08.970 --> 15:09.930
But before the Battle,

15:10.170 --> 15:11.610
Chancellor Xu once

15:11.930 --> 15:13.530
visited Yuhua Temple

15:13.890 --> 15:15.410
to meet the lady from He family,

15:15.570 --> 15:16.730
He Rufei's sister.

15:17.210 --> 15:18.410
I wonder

15:18.730 --> 15:20.130
what he is up to.

15:25.810 --> 15:27.570
Now He Rufei's deployed to Huayuan,

15:28.850 --> 15:30.290
Mingshui Battle's tragedy

15:30.290 --> 15:31.010
might repeat.

15:31.490 --> 15:32.690
Send a message to Feinu.

15:33.250 --> 15:34.170
Tell him to

15:35.370 --> 15:36.650
keep watching He Rufei.

15:37.370 --> 15:37.950
Understood.

15:54.570 --> 15:55.610
Why are you here?

15:56.450 --> 15:57.530
I parted from you

15:57.850 --> 15:58.690
without thanking you.

15:59.530 --> 16:00.210
I asked around

16:00.410 --> 16:01.370
and knew you're here.

16:01.970 --> 16:02.650
For what?

16:04.250 --> 16:05.490
For you saved me in Jiyang!

16:05.770 --> 16:06.570
I still remember it.

16:07.770 --> 16:08.490
It was nothing.

16:08.930 --> 16:09.450
Not at all.

16:14.450 --> 16:15.930
At present, in the imperial court,

16:16.410 --> 16:18.090
many fear and resent Xiao Jue.

16:18.610 --> 16:19.490
His future is unclear.

16:20.410 --> 16:21.210
If anything occurs,

16:21.610 --> 16:22.610
you might be implicated.

16:23.410 --> 16:25.130
Though General Wu'an's post
holds low rank,

16:25.730 --> 16:26.730
it allows you

16:27.170 --> 16:28.490
to go wherever you want

16:29.050 --> 16:30.050
and have broader options.

16:30.730 --> 16:31.570
Isn't it good?

16:35.170 --> 16:37.250
Promotion is undoubtedly favorable.

16:37.890 --> 16:38.970
I should be pleased.

16:41.570 --> 16:42.090
Mr. He,

16:43.010 --> 16:44.250
have you ever considered

16:44.730 --> 16:45.930
that to achieve greatness,

16:46.730 --> 16:47.370
you needn't

16:47.410 --> 16:48.850
limit yourself to Yezhou?

16:56.410 --> 16:57.690
Would you like to see the world

16:58.530 --> 16:59.490
and venture into it

17:00.290 --> 17:00.970
with me?

17:16.890 --> 17:18.050
I appreciate it, Mr. Chu.

17:19.089 --> 17:20.050
Perhaps one day,

17:20.810 --> 17:22.050
I'll leave the Yezhou Garrison.

17:22.930 --> 17:23.890
That's because

17:24.650 --> 17:25.170
I need to do

17:25.210 --> 17:26.450
what I must do,

17:27.290 --> 17:28.690
but not Yezhou's harsh conditions.

17:31.330 --> 17:32.130
Is that all?

17:33.330 --> 17:34.130
Not because of

17:35.010 --> 17:35.810
someone?

17:40.650 --> 17:41.690
In this world,

17:42.690 --> 17:43.570
everything can change.

17:44.690 --> 17:45.370
No one

17:46.330 --> 17:47.810
can stay by anyone's side forever.

17:49.730 --> 17:51.930
I'm simply doing

17:52.810 --> 17:54.370
what I want.

18:00.370 --> 18:00.960
Mr. Chu.

18:01.170 --> 18:02.080
It's getting late.

18:02.930 --> 18:03.460
See you.

18:25.370 --> 18:25.950
Commander.

18:26.290 --> 18:26.850
What is it?

18:27.370 --> 18:28.030
General Feihong

18:28.330 --> 18:29.370
won the Huayuan Battle.

18:32.370 --> 18:33.450
He Rufei has

18:33.450 --> 18:34.370
so many soldiers.

18:34.650 --> 18:36.130
Even a child could've

18:36.370 --> 18:36.930
won.

18:37.130 --> 18:38.090
Any other updates?

18:39.010 --> 18:39.930
The battle was won,

18:40.330 --> 18:41.410
but seven deputy generals

18:41.570 --> 18:43.130
under General Feihong died.

18:44.130 --> 18:44.850
So,

18:45.570 --> 18:46.850
he won the Huayuan Battle

18:47.610 --> 18:48.370
in a tragic way?

18:48.850 --> 18:49.890
Many people died,

18:51.450 --> 18:52.330
even including

18:52.810 --> 18:53.890
seven deputy generals?

18:55.290 --> 18:56.570
Doesn't this feel familiar?

18:57.210 --> 18:58.090
The Huayuan Battle

18:59.330 --> 19:00.450
mirrors

19:00.450 --> 19:01.930
the Mingshui Battle's trajectory.

19:02.530 --> 19:03.850
Though appearing flawless,

19:04.410 --> 19:05.770
it's full of suspicions.

19:06.690 --> 19:07.300
Exactly.

19:08.010 --> 19:09.010
I've never met them,

19:09.330 --> 19:10.930
but Fuyue Army's seven deputy generals

19:11.010 --> 19:11.730
were legendary.

19:12.210 --> 19:13.370
Each was capable,

19:13.890 --> 19:15.210
yet all died on the battlefield?

19:15.970 --> 19:16.930
There's no such thing

19:16.970 --> 19:17.850
as coincidence here.

19:18.930 --> 19:19.770
Did He Rufei

19:20.370 --> 19:21.170
murder them

19:21.970 --> 19:22.650
on purpose?

19:23.410 --> 19:24.250
In that case,

19:24.810 --> 19:26.050
what for?

19:27.170 --> 19:28.010
He must

19:29.050 --> 19:30.090
do it for

19:30.130 --> 19:31.530
hiding something.

19:33.130 --> 19:33.930
(So,)

19:34.450 --> 19:35.810
(this He Rufei is)

19:36.690 --> 19:38.250
(the schemer)

19:38.290 --> 19:39.690
(from the Mingshui Battle.)

19:44.450 --> 19:45.120
Where's He Yan?

20:07.600 --> 20:09.410
(Maningbu, Wutuo Chancellor)

20:12.130 --> 20:13.810
You're late.

20:13.850 --> 20:15.290
Three penalty drinks.

20:16.010 --> 20:17.450
I need to act in discretion,

20:17.890 --> 20:19.890
hence being cautious

20:20.130 --> 20:20.850
delays me.

20:21.130 --> 20:22.370
I beg your forgiveness.

20:22.610 --> 20:23.170
Don't be.

20:23.370 --> 20:23.900
Take a seat.

20:27.250 --> 20:27.810
Here.

20:28.890 --> 20:30.290
I heard, at the Huayuan Battle,

20:30.690 --> 20:31.690
your emperor

20:31.890 --> 20:33.570
sent you to lead the troops.

20:36.810 --> 20:37.810
You are quite

20:38.090 --> 20:39.210
well-informed.

20:39.530 --> 20:41.530
You asked me to come

20:41.810 --> 20:43.010
not merely for drinks,

20:43.490 --> 20:44.170
right?

20:45.890 --> 20:46.930
Since we

20:46.930 --> 20:48.170
are old acquaintances,

20:48.530 --> 20:49.610
so I'll be direct.

20:50.450 --> 20:51.330
I must win

20:52.290 --> 20:53.210
the Huayuan Battle.

20:56.010 --> 20:57.850
We got defeated in Jiyang,

20:58.250 --> 20:59.650
and need this victory

20:59.890 --> 21:00.650
to restore morale.

21:00.970 --> 21:02.530
I'd ask you to let us

21:02.570 --> 21:03.290
win once.

21:03.730 --> 21:04.730
Losing Huayuan

21:05.450 --> 21:06.410
would leave me

21:06.410 --> 21:08.050
unable to face our king.

21:08.690 --> 21:10.170
How about

21:10.490 --> 21:12.330
compensate by exchanging Rundu

21:13.010 --> 21:13.570
for Huayuan?

21:15.210 --> 21:15.850
Rundu?

21:16.530 --> 21:18.010
Rundu is the gateway

21:18.010 --> 21:18.930
to Yaojing,

21:19.810 --> 21:21.090
more crucial than Huayuan.

21:21.210 --> 21:22.250
Do you mean it?

21:29.930 --> 21:30.770
This is...

21:31.190 --> 21:33.010
(Rundu Military Defense Map)

21:34.530 --> 21:35.810
Rundu Military Defense Map?

21:36.210 --> 21:38.010
General Li Kuang defending Rundu

21:38.130 --> 21:40.370
is one of the Eight Warriors
from the Fuyue Army.

21:40.690 --> 21:42.210
Once Wutuo attacks Rundu

21:42.410 --> 21:43.450
and he's overwhelmed,

21:43.490 --> 21:45.170
he'll request aid from the Fuyue Army.

21:45.690 --> 21:46.370
And I

21:46.730 --> 21:48.370
will never aid him.

21:49.290 --> 21:50.450
To show my sincerity,

21:50.570 --> 21:51.850
once war breaks out in Huayuan,

21:52.050 --> 21:53.290
I'm willing to sacrifice

21:53.450 --> 21:55.410
the lives
of other seven deputy generals.

21:57.850 --> 21:58.810
The Eight Warriors

21:59.570 --> 22:00.730
and Rundu city,

22:01.930 --> 22:02.970
in exchange for Huayuan.

22:04.770 --> 22:06.730
What a bargain!

22:10.130 --> 22:12.050
Since you show such sincerity,

22:12.170 --> 22:12.810
I shall

22:13.010 --> 22:14.450
do you a favor.

22:14.490 --> 22:15.010
Good.

22:17.450 --> 22:18.730
Surprise,

22:19.450 --> 22:19.970
He Yan?

22:20.650 --> 22:21.970
All seven of your warriors

22:21.970 --> 22:23.610
have died in Huayuan.

22:24.050 --> 22:24.640
Rest assured.

22:25.490 --> 22:26.930
The remaining Li Kuang

22:27.530 --> 22:28.810
won't escape either.

22:30.570 --> 22:32.010
Once he's gone,

22:32.570 --> 22:34.570
you will never

22:35.810 --> 22:38.490
see hope again.

22:40.690 --> 22:41.650
Did you sneak food

22:41.850 --> 22:42.930
last night?

22:43.890 --> 22:45.010
That must be Wang Ba!

22:45.250 --> 22:46.290
Why would I do so?

22:46.810 --> 22:47.330
Anyway,

22:47.450 --> 22:48.330
that General Feihong

22:48.330 --> 22:49.290
is utterly useless.

22:51.490 --> 22:52.370
- He.
- He.

22:52.770 --> 22:53.530
Congratulations!

22:55.010 --> 22:55.530
He

22:55.530 --> 22:56.490
won't stop here.

22:56.930 --> 22:58.050
You are brave and astute,

22:58.370 --> 22:59.450
must achieve something big.

23:00.890 --> 23:01.410
Jiang Jiao.

23:01.770 --> 23:02.530
What did you say

23:02.650 --> 23:03.650
about General Feihong?

23:04.850 --> 23:06.250
General Feihong?

23:06.410 --> 23:08.090
All seven men he led

23:08.250 --> 23:09.290
died on the battlefield.

23:09.410 --> 23:12.050
He's not a General at all!

23:13.610 --> 23:14.530
Seven Warriors

23:17.050 --> 23:18.410
died on the battlefield?

24:05.500 --> 24:06.090
(As)

24:06.090 --> 24:07.130
(General Feihong's plan),

24:07.650 --> 24:08.650
we'd push them back

24:08.810 --> 24:09.650
through the valley

24:09.970 --> 24:11.290
and watch them flee.

24:11.370 --> 24:12.130
How pleasant!

24:12.450 --> 24:13.450
Right!

24:22.370 --> 24:23.410
(All soldiers!)

24:24.170 --> 24:25.050
Yes!

24:26.450 --> 24:27.170
Today's battle

24:27.890 --> 24:28.650
is fought for Wei,

24:29.450 --> 24:30.890
and peace across the land!

24:31.650 --> 24:32.570
Be fearless of death!

24:33.210 --> 24:34.130
Return only victorious!

24:35.170 --> 24:35.770
Never

24:36.370 --> 24:38.050
dishonor our Fuyue Army's name!

24:38.650 --> 24:39.970
Be fearless of death!

24:40.290 --> 24:41.650
Return only victorious!

24:41.930 --> 24:43.210
(Be fearless of death!)

24:43.490 --> 24:45.010
(Return only victorious!)

24:45.370 --> 24:46.810
(Be fearless of death!)

24:47.250 --> 24:48.650
(Return only victorious!)

26:19.730 --> 26:20.330
Seven Warriors

26:21.690 --> 26:23.130
were important to you.

26:24.410 --> 26:25.610
Now that they died,

26:25.810 --> 26:26.690
you must be in pain.

26:27.850 --> 26:29.370
However, you shall not be punished,

26:29.970 --> 26:31.050
but He Rufei.

26:33.570 --> 26:34.930
He Rufei!

26:37.570 --> 26:38.930
I will

26:40.410 --> 26:41.610
revenge you!

27:02.370 --> 27:02.880
Let me.

27:53.370 --> 27:55.250
My seven men died.

27:58.330 --> 28:00.090
I can't kill the murderer for them,

28:01.890 --> 28:03.290
nor pay tribute to them.

28:08.730 --> 28:10.410
And I can't even shed tears.

28:11.930 --> 28:13.050
If not for me,

28:14.010 --> 28:15.890
they wouldn't have died!

28:21.610 --> 28:22.370
This pain

28:23.330 --> 28:25.090
constantly reminds me

28:27.410 --> 28:28.090
I must

28:30.090 --> 28:31.610
make this vengeance.

28:41.690 --> 28:43.370
Both my parents passed away,

28:44.330 --> 28:45.930
I had no time to mourn properly.

28:46.890 --> 28:48.370
Everyone accused me

28:48.930 --> 28:50.370
of being heartless and cold.

28:52.810 --> 28:54.490
But every time I don this armor,

28:55.730 --> 28:56.810
every time I carry

28:57.730 --> 28:58.930
the pouch made by my mother,

28:59.810 --> 29:00.610
I realize

29:04.370 --> 29:05.610
they've always been

29:09.690 --> 29:10.650
in my heart.

29:14.330 --> 29:15.010
You and I

29:16.690 --> 29:18.330
always share similar experiences.

29:20.130 --> 29:21.090
Be it our pasts

29:22.530 --> 29:23.490
or present,

29:26.610 --> 29:27.450
your pains

29:30.130 --> 29:31.330
resonate within me.

29:36.530 --> 29:37.410
It was you...

29:40.410 --> 29:41.610
Because of you,

29:45.490 --> 29:46.650
I choose to believe.

29:48.010 --> 29:49.810
General Fengyun Xiao Jue,

29:50.210 --> 29:52.770
immediately go to Peidu
to meet His Majesty.

30:04.720 --> 30:07.870
(Xiao)

30:11.330 --> 30:12.650
Commander, take care.

30:15.090 --> 30:16.130
Won't you come with me?

30:17.650 --> 30:18.410
I won't go.

30:21.050 --> 30:22.330
Wait for me at Yezhou Garrison.

30:23.170 --> 30:23.890
When I return,

30:24.930 --> 30:26.050
I have things to tell you.

31:17.130 --> 31:17.890
This is soaked

31:17.890 --> 31:19.210
with Commander Xiao's blood.

31:19.730 --> 31:21.050
I've been scrubbing it for long.

31:22.130 --> 31:23.170
That General Yan He

31:23.250 --> 31:24.370
is truly ruthless.

31:27.970 --> 31:29.410
Though he's dashing,

31:30.130 --> 31:31.450
quite accomplished for his age.

31:32.330 --> 31:33.850
He's dashing, but he's been married.

31:34.410 --> 31:35.290
Stop dreaming.

31:36.570 --> 31:37.850
I'm not dreaming.

31:38.530 --> 31:40.090
My ambitions remain unfulfilled.

31:40.850 --> 31:42.330
I have no time for that.

31:58.170 --> 31:59.370
I'm not as ambitious as you.

31:59.970 --> 32:01.050
I'm thinking of a lady.

32:04.890 --> 32:05.850
Who is she?

32:07.170 --> 32:07.930
She's determined

32:08.570 --> 32:09.370
with a temper.

32:11.330 --> 32:12.330
What?

32:13.130 --> 32:14.130
Yet she's wise,

32:14.570 --> 32:15.290
possessing

32:15.570 --> 32:17.210
a compassionate heart.

32:19.290 --> 32:20.610
That's all?

32:22.650 --> 32:24.250
She's never hypocritical,

32:25.050 --> 32:26.130
always genuine with others.

32:27.410 --> 32:28.610
This is why she captivates me.

32:41.060 --> 32:45.110
(Wei's Palace, Cheng'an Hall)

33:23.170 --> 33:23.970
Xiao,

33:25.130 --> 33:26.650
you are being hesitant,

33:27.130 --> 33:28.130
not quite

33:28.130 --> 33:29.050
your style.

33:31.010 --> 33:32.210
You are a strategy master,

33:32.570 --> 33:33.340
so I have to

33:33.770 --> 33:35.050
be cautious

33:35.770 --> 33:36.610
in my actions.

33:37.770 --> 33:38.570
You are

33:38.570 --> 33:39.930
really flattering me.

33:40.890 --> 33:41.530
If I am

33:42.330 --> 33:44.130
really a strategy master,

33:44.690 --> 33:45.490
the borders

33:45.970 --> 33:47.770
wouldn't be in such turmoil

33:48.530 --> 33:50.450
and our people tormented.

33:57.450 --> 33:58.210
I'm sorry.

33:59.170 --> 34:00.050
I deserve punishment.

34:01.490 --> 34:02.530
I'm merely reflecting,

34:02.530 --> 34:03.250
not blaming you.

34:04.130 --> 34:04.770
Sit down.

34:04.970 --> 34:06.050
Our game is still going.

34:18.449 --> 34:19.570
After taking 20 strikes,

34:20.730 --> 34:21.570
you must be injured.

34:24.850 --> 34:25.650
I'm

34:25.650 --> 34:26.530
mostly healed.

34:27.330 --> 34:28.409
Thank you for your concern.

34:29.770 --> 34:31.010
Being caned

34:31.570 --> 34:32.850
20 strikes publicly,

34:33.489 --> 34:34.570
do you think

34:35.530 --> 34:36.810
I'm unfair?

34:40.210 --> 34:40.929
I wouldn't dare.

34:41.650 --> 34:43.210
I deserved punishment

34:43.889 --> 34:45.050
for being absent in my post.

34:48.889 --> 34:49.810
On the one hand,

34:50.489 --> 34:51.530
as a commander,

34:52.130 --> 34:53.610
you violated military discipline,

34:53.810 --> 34:54.650
shall be punished

34:54.850 --> 34:55.810
to restore discipline.

34:56.370 --> 34:57.130
On the other hand,

34:57.810 --> 34:59.730
you risked your life
to achieve great feats,

35:00.290 --> 35:01.650
yet I had to punish you.

35:02.210 --> 35:02.890
Thus,

35:03.450 --> 35:04.890
I owe it to you,

35:05.810 --> 35:07.810
and seek to compensate you.

35:23.770 --> 35:24.570
Don't be.

35:25.450 --> 35:27.490
I don't deserve it.

35:30.130 --> 35:30.660
However,

35:31.690 --> 35:33.210
I do have something to report.

35:38.360 --> 35:40.940
(Lanhui Pavilion)

35:57.570 --> 35:58.110
Mister.

35:59.330 --> 35:59.850
Is

36:00.330 --> 36:01.170
His Majesty asleep?

36:01.610 --> 36:02.250
Not yet.

36:03.010 --> 36:04.130
His Majesty and General Xiao

36:04.370 --> 36:05.290
are in a chess game.

36:05.890 --> 36:07.290
Then please inform His Majesty

36:07.970 --> 36:09.650
that I am here

36:10.010 --> 36:11.210
to beg for punishment.

36:11.690 --> 36:13.090
His Majesty said,

36:13.610 --> 36:14.890
before the game concludes,

36:15.250 --> 36:16.690
no disturbances shall be permitted.

36:17.530 --> 36:18.770
Then I shall wait here.

36:30.490 --> 36:31.410
I see.

36:34.250 --> 36:36.170
This outcome truly surprised me.

36:38.090 --> 36:39.490
This isn't merely complicated,

36:40.330 --> 36:42.050
could even be called

36:42.050 --> 36:43.090
extraordinary.

36:44.610 --> 36:45.380
Your Majesty.

36:47.890 --> 36:48.570
Rest assured.

36:49.210 --> 36:50.210
I keep my word.

36:51.050 --> 36:52.890
Having granted your request,

36:53.850 --> 36:55.130
I shall not regret.

37:03.210 --> 37:03.730
I

37:04.050 --> 37:05.090
appreciate it.

37:09.810 --> 37:13.490
(Lanhui Pavilion)

37:30.900 --> 37:33.280
(Lanhui Pavilion)

37:40.530 --> 37:41.210
General He.

37:42.210 --> 37:43.090
Long time no see.

37:45.690 --> 37:47.450
Indeed.

37:48.130 --> 37:48.770
General Xiao,

37:49.570 --> 37:51.650
I heard you were punished.

37:52.050 --> 37:52.730
How are you

37:53.210 --> 37:54.050
now?

37:55.930 --> 37:57.090
Better than you.

37:57.610 --> 37:58.240
After all,

37:58.770 --> 38:00.370
you rushed here to claim merits,

38:00.930 --> 38:02.730
yet spent the night chilled outside.

38:03.530 --> 38:04.890
You might catch cold.

38:06.650 --> 38:07.450
General Xiao,

38:08.090 --> 38:09.330
this joke

38:09.850 --> 38:11.170
isn't amusing.

38:14.010 --> 38:15.170
Indeed, compared to

38:15.250 --> 38:16.650
your performance at Huayuan Battle.

38:17.690 --> 38:18.330
Xiao Jue.

38:18.890 --> 38:20.170
Don't try to

38:21.010 --> 38:22.930
slander me here.

38:24.210 --> 38:24.850
I've heard,

38:25.330 --> 38:26.250
in the Huayuan Battle,

38:26.890 --> 38:28.370
you're late for reinforcements

38:29.210 --> 38:30.410
somehow.

38:32.010 --> 38:33.410
This reminds me of

38:34.130 --> 38:35.210
your late arrival

38:36.770 --> 38:39.330
at the Mingshui Battle as well.

38:40.490 --> 38:42.010
I wonder if you deserve your title,

38:42.610 --> 38:44.330
General Feihong?

38:46.970 --> 38:47.570
Or perhaps

38:49.170 --> 38:50.210
there's some secret?

38:54.570 --> 38:55.490
Xiao Jue!

38:56.330 --> 38:58.210
Heed the imperial decree!

39:03.210 --> 39:05.410
For crushing the Wutuo Army at Huayuan

39:05.970 --> 39:07.010
and returning victorious,

39:07.090 --> 39:08.610
General Feihong,

39:08.690 --> 39:09.770
you've performed well,

39:09.890 --> 39:11.210
and pleased me.

39:11.490 --> 39:13.730
Considering your arduous journey

39:13.890 --> 39:15.010
and the strain of travel,

39:15.450 --> 39:17.050
so court formalities are waived.

39:17.170 --> 39:18.810
Return promptly to camp

39:18.970 --> 39:20.370
and prepare the troops.

39:23.690 --> 39:24.890
I want to see His Majesty!

39:25.050 --> 39:27.570
His Majesty is asleep.

39:29.930 --> 39:30.650
I

39:31.530 --> 39:32.210
accept it.

39:39.890 --> 39:41.690
His Majesty truly concerns you.

39:42.690 --> 39:43.770
Please don't

39:44.130 --> 39:45.370
let His Majesty down

39:47.810 --> 39:48.890
and return to your camp

39:50.370 --> 39:51.450
soon.

40:02.800 --> 40:05.210
(Yezhou Huayuan)

40:05.210 --> 40:07.130
Li Kuang is my remaining subordinate.

40:07.610 --> 40:09.130
He Rufei will certainly eliminate him.

40:09.810 --> 40:10.890
If Rundu faces danger,

40:11.290 --> 40:13.010
He Rufei won't send reinforcement.

40:14.010 --> 40:14.930
By that time,

40:15.050 --> 40:15.970
it'll be too late.

40:17.570 --> 40:19.290
(Rundu)
Rundu is defended by Li Kuang

40:20.210 --> 40:21.570
and is a military stronghold.

40:23.170 --> 40:24.130
I must go there.

40:58.130 --> 40:59.850
(I won't let Li Kuang die.)

41:00.770 --> 41:02.370
(Nor will I let Rundu fall.)

41:11.190 --> 41:16.860
(Lend me a sword
to aid the Rundu crisis.)

41:17.210 --> 41:19.370
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

41:19.470 --> 41:23.390
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

41:23.570 --> 41:25.510
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

41:25.610 --> 41:30.540
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

41:42.630 --> 41:44.040
♪I've seen the mountains♪

41:44.240 --> 41:45.660
♪And trodden through ice♪

41:45.920 --> 41:48.740
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

41:49.040 --> 41:50.440
♪Destiny is my creed♪

41:50.490 --> 41:51.890
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

41:52.040 --> 41:53.840
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

41:55.040 --> 41:56.510
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

41:56.680 --> 41:57.960
♪Gazing through the mire♪

41:58.140 --> 42:00.530
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

42:00.730 --> 42:02.780
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

42:03.920 --> 42:05.750
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

42:07.710 --> 42:10.630
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

42:10.720 --> 42:13.380
♪There must always be a longing♪

42:13.830 --> 42:18.900
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

42:19.230 --> 42:21.240
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

42:21.550 --> 42:25.200
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

42:25.430 --> 42:27.320
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

42:27.360 --> 42:31.200
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

42:31.550 --> 42:33.490
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

42:33.680 --> 42:37.500
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

42:37.760 --> 42:43.510
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

42:44.400 --> 42:49.870
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

42:57.020 --> 42:59.940
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

43:00.030 --> 43:02.690
♪There must always be a longing♪

